        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the pillow suitable for all sleeping positions?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, the Ergonomic Sleep Pillow is designed to support both back and side sleepers. Its unique shape promotes proper alignment regardless of your preferred position.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What materials are used in the pillow?",
            "answer": "<p>The pillow features high-density memory foam for optimal support and a soft, breathable cover for comfort and temperature regulation.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does it take to adapt to the pillow?",
            "answer": "<p>Most users report a comfortable adjustment period of just a few nights as the memory foam conforms to their unique shape.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can the pillow help with neck pain?",
            "answer": "<p>Many users have experienced relief from neck pain due to the pillow's ergonomic design, which promotes proper spinal alignment during sleep.</p>"
